# 统一 LF，防开发机 CRLF 污染弹幕 ASS/XML 等文本产物
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cs text eol=lf
*.csproj text eol=lf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.slnx text eol=crlf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制素材（官方素材禁止入库，此处仅限自绘/生成产物）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary

# 上游 vendored 树：不参与换行归一化（防上游 CRLF/LF 被我们改写），也不让 GitHub 语言条把它算进主语言
vendor/** -text linguist-vendored
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
